rem Maximising a Weighted Product
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=190
rem Sum the integer parts of the largest
rem products x1 x2^2 ... xm^m with
rem x1 + ... + xm = m, for m = 2 to Top

use sequences
use io
use cli

option Top integer = 15

rem Lagrange multipliers give x[i] =
rem 2 i / (m + 1), so the product is
rem the product of (2 i)^i over
rem (m + 1) to the power m (m + 1) / 2.
Rows = Top - 1
M = (2 to Top array) reshape Rows 1
I = (1 to Top array) reshape 1 Top
Pow' = (2 * I) ** I
Terms' = (I at most M) choose Pow 1
Num' = Terms reduce * axis 1
Den' = (M + 1) ** (M * (M + 1) // 2)
Best' = Num // (Den reshape Rows)
Answer = Best sum
Answer print
